"inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413872399","position":2,"url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413872399","name":"Does Dunkin' have banana pudding cold foam?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dunkin' released a banana cold foam inspired by banana pudding as part of its limited-time spring banana lineup. Since it's only around for a limited time, this homemade version means you can enjoy it any time of year!","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413885447","position":3,"url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413885447","name":"Can I make banana pudding cold foam ahead of time?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It's best made right before serving, since the pudding mix keeps thickening as it sits. It only takes about 10 seconds to froth, so it's easy to make fresh!","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413904227","position":4,"url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#faq-question-1791413904227","name":"Can I make my own cold brew?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Learning how to make banana cold brew starts with good cold brew, so steep coarsely ground coffee in cold water in the fridge for 12 to 24 hours, then strain it. Keep it in the fridge so it's ready whenever you are.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Recipe","name":"Banana Pudding Cold Brew (w/Banana Pudding Cold Foam)","author":{"@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/#/schema/person/b571eabf6943b7a3f58a63bb64da9949"},"description":"This Banana Pudding Cold Brew tastes just like banana pudding in coffee form, with a thick, creamy banana pudding cold foam on top. Ready in just 2 minutes!","datePublished":"2026-10-07T16:02:57+00:00","image":["https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1200x1200-1.jpg","https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1200x1200-1-500x500.jpg","https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1200x1200-1-500x375.jpg","https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1200x1200-1-480x270.jpg"],"video":{"name":"Banana Pudding Cold Brew - No Title.mp4","description":"","thumbnailUrl":"https://content.jwplatform.com/thumbs/NO34NBg5-720.jpg","contentUrl":"https://content.jwplatform.com/videos/NO34NBg5.mp4","uploadDate":"2026-10-07T23:07:35+00:00","@type":"VideoObject"},"recipeYield":["1","1 drink"],"prepTime":"PT2M","totalTime":"PT2M","recipeIngredient":["3 tbsp whole milk","2 tbsp  heavy cream","2  tsp Instant banana pudding mix","1 ½ cups cold brew coffee","1 tbsp banana bread syrup","ice"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Make your banana pudding cold foam. Add the whole milk, heavy cream, and banana pudding mix in a small glass and froth for about 10 seconds. Set aside.","name":"Make your banana pudding cold foam. Add the whole milk, heavy cream, and banana pudding mix in a small glass and froth for about 10 seconds. Set aside.","url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#wprm-recipe-10360-step-0-0"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Add ice to a tall glass, then add the cold brew and the banana bread syrup and stir to combine.","name":"Add ice to a tall glass, then add the cold brew and the banana bread syrup and stir to combine.","url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#wprm-recipe-10360-step-0-1"},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Top with the banana pudding cold foam, then drink up!","name":"Top with the banana pudding cold foam, then drink up!","url":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#wprm-recipe-10360-step-0-2"}],"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"5","ratingCount":"1"},"recipeCategory":["Drinks"],"recipeCuisine":["American"],"keywords":"Banana Pudding Cold Brew","nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","servingSize":"1 drink","calories":"215 kcal","carbohydrateContent":"25 g","proteinContent":"2 g","fatContent":"12 g","sodiumContent":"185 mg","sugarContent":"20 g"},"@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/#recipe","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/"}]}</script>
