</header><div class="entry-content"><div class="wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-snippet wprm-recipe-template-snippet-basic"><a href="#recipe" data-recipe="10360" style="color: #333333;" class="wprm-recipe-jump wprm-recipe-link wprm-jump-to-recipe-shortcode wprm-block-text-normal">Jump to Recipe</a> - <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/wprm_print/banana-pudding-cold-brew-w-banana-pudding-cold-foam" style="color: #333333;" class="wprm-recipe-print wprm-recipe-link wprm-print-recipe-shortcode wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe-id="10360" data-template="" target="_blank" rel="nofollow">Print Recipe</a></div>
<p class="has-text-align-center">This <strong>Banana Pudding Cold Brew</strong> is smooth cold brew sweetened with banana bread syrup and topped with the dreamiest banana pudding cold foam! It tastes just like a scoop of classic banana pudding floating on top of your iced coffee. And it comes together in just 2 minutes!</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-url="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/?tp_image_id=10354" data-pin-title="Banana Pudding Cold Brew (w/Banana Pudding Cold Foam)" src="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1.jpg" alt="" data-skip-lazy class="wp-image-10354" srcset="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1.jpg 1200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-200x300.jpg 200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-360x540.jpg 360w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-180x270.jpg 180w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-1-1200x1800-1-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>    <div class="dpsp-email-save-this-tool " style="background-color: #c5f1de;">        <div class="hubbub-save-this-form-wrapper"><h3 class="hubbub-save-this-heading">Save This Recipe to Your Email!</h3><div class="hubbub-save-this-message"><p>We'll email this recipe to you, so you can come back to it later!</p></div><div class="hubbub-save-this-form-only-wrapper"><form name="hubbub-save-this-form" method="post" action="">                    <input type="text" name="hubbub-save-this-snare" class="hubbub-save-this-snare hubbub-block-save-this-snare" />