<p>The cold foam is my copycat of the banana pudding-inspired cold foam Dunkin' rolled out with their limited-time banana drinks this spring. The secret ingredient is instant banana pudding mix, which makes the foam thick, creamy, and so banana-y. Now you can make this Dunkin' banana pudding cold foam copycat at home whenever you want!</p>



<p>The cold brew gets sweetened with my <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-bread-syrup-for-coffee/">homemade banana bread syrup</a>, which adds a warm, cozy banana bread flavor to every sip. If you love banana in your coffee as much as I do, my <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/homemade-banana-bread-creamer/">Banana Bread Creamer</a> is a must for your morning cup too!</p>



<p>And if you're a cold foam fan, don't miss my <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-bread-latte-w-banana-cold-foam/">Banana Bread Latte with Banana Cold Foam</a>! Grab your frother and let's make this!</p>


