<h2 id="what-does-a-banana-pudding-cold-brew-taste-like"   class="wp-block-heading" >What Does a Banana Pudding Cold Brew Taste Like?</h2>



<p>This drink tastes like banana pudding coffee in the best way! The cold foam is sweet, creamy, and full of that classic vanilla-banana pudding flavor, while the banana bread syrup adds a cozy, bakery-style sweetness to the cold brew.</p>



<p>The cold brew keeps everything smooth and bold, so it never tastes too sweet. Every sip gives you a little creamy foam and a little coffee, just like the perfect bite of banana pudding!</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-url="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/?tp_image_id=10355" data-pin-title="Banana Pudding Cold Brew (w/Banana Pudding Cold Foam)" src="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-10355" srcset="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1.jpg 1200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-200x300.jpg 200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-360x540.jpg 360w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-180x270.jpg 180w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-2-1200x1800-1-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>



<h2 id="why-youll-love-this-banana-pudding-cold-brew"   class="wp-block-heading">Why You'll Love This Banana Pudding Cold Brew</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>2-minute drink:</strong> This comes together in just 2 minutes, especially if you keep cold brew in the fridge. It's perfect for busy mornings!</li>



<li><strong>Dunkin' vibes at home:</strong> The banana pudding cold foam tastes just like the one from Dunkin', but you can make it any time of year. No drive-thru required!</li>



<li><strong>Thick, fluffy foam:</strong> The pudding mix makes the foam extra thick and fluffy, so it sits right on top of your cold brew instead of sinking. It's like magic!</li>



<li><strong>Simple ingredients:</strong> Cold brew, banana bread syrup, milk, cream, and pudding mix. That's all you need for this easy cold brew recipe!</li>



<li><strong>Smooth, not too sweet:</strong> Cold brew is naturally smooth and less bitter, so it pairs perfectly with the sweet banana flavors. Every sip is perfectly balanced.</li>
</ul>



<h2 id="ingredients-needed"   class="wp-block-heading" >Ingredients Needed</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Cold brew coffee:</strong> This is the smooth, bold base of the drink, and it's naturally less bitter than regular iced coffee.</li>



<li><strong>Banana bread syrup:</strong> This sweetens the cold brew and adds a warm, cozy banana bread flavor that turns it into the ultimate iced banana coffee.</li>



<li><strong>Whole milk and heavy cream:</strong> Together they make the cold foam! The heavy cream makes it rich and fluffy, while the whole milk keeps it light enough to froth up fast.</li>



<li><strong>Instant banana pudding mix:</strong> The secret ingredient! It thickens the cold foam instantly and gives it that classic banana pudding flavor.</li>
</ul>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-url="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/?tp_image_id=10350" data-pin-title="Banana Pudding Cold Brew (w/Banana Pudding Cold Foam)" src="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-10350" srcset="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients.jpg 1200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-200x300.jpg 200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-360x540.jpg 360w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-180x270.jpg 180w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-Ingredients-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>



<h2 id="substitutions"   class="wp-block-heading" >Substitutions</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Cold brew coffee:</strong> No cold brew? Chilled strong brewed coffee or an iced latte are great instead! </li>



<li><strong>Banana bread syrup:</strong> Store-bought banana syrup works in a pinch. You can also use vanilla syrup for a more classic vanilla-banana pudding flavor.</li>



<li><strong>Instant banana pudding mix:</strong> Vanilla instant pudding mix works if you can't find banana, and it tastes more like the vanilla wafer part of banana pudding. Make sure it's instant pudding, not cook-and-serve, so it thickens without heat.</li>



<li><strong>Dairy-free:</strong> Soy milk or a barista-style oat milk works best for the foam, since instant pudding doesn't thicken as well with some plant milks. Check your pudding mix label too, since some brands contain dairy.</li>
</ul>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-url="https://coffeecopycat.com/banana-pudding-cold-brew/?tp_image_id=10357" data-pin-title="Banana Pudding Cold Brew (w/Banana Pudding Cold Foam)" src="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-10357" srcset="https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1.jpg 1200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-200x300.jpg 200w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-720x1080.jpg 720w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-360x540.jpg 360w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-180x270.jpg 180w, https://coffeecopycat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Banana-Pudding-Cold-Brew-4-1200x1800-1-150x225.jpg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></figure>



<h2 id="how-to-make-a-banana-pudding-cold-brew"   class="wp-block-heading" >How to Make a Banana Pudding Cold Brew</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Step 1: Make the banana pudding cold foam</strong>. This is how to make banana pudding cold foam in seconds! Add the whole milk, heavy cream, and banana pudding mix to a small glass and froth for about 10 seconds until thick. Set it aside.</li>



<li><strong>Step 2. Build the cold brew</strong>. Fill a tall glass with ice, then add the cold brew and banana bread syrup. Stir to combine.</li>



<li><strong>Step 3. Top and enjoy</strong>. Spoon the banana pudding cold foam over the top of the cold brew, then drink up!</li>
</ul>



