<h2 id="optional-variations"   class="wp-block-heading">Optional Variations</h2>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Vanilla Wafer Crunch:</strong> Crush a few vanilla wafers over the cold foam for that classic banana pudding crunch. It's the cutest topping!</li>



<li><strong>Banana Pudding Iced Latte:</strong> Swap the cold brew for espresso and milk over ice for a creamier latte version. Top it with the same banana pudding cold foam!</li>



<li><strong>Caramel Banana Cold Brew:</strong> Drizzle <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/homemade-caramel-sauce/">caramel sauce</a> inside the glass before adding ice for a sweet banana-caramel twist.</li>



<li><strong>Cinnamon Banana Cold Brew:</strong> Sprinkle a little cinnamon over the cold foam for a warm, cozy finish. It tastes just like banana bread!</li>



<li><strong>Banana Pudding Matcha:</strong> Spoon the banana pudding cold foam over an <a href="https://coffeecopycat.com/iced-banana-bread-matcha-starbucks-copycat/">iced matcha latte</a> for a fun, non-coffee banana drink.</li>
</ul>



