<h2 id="nutritional-info"   class="wp-block-heading" >Nutritional Info</h2>



<p>This banana coffee drink comes in at 215 calories, with most of the fat coming from the heavy cream in the cold foam. The sugar comes from the banana bread syrup and pudding mix, and the instant pudding mix adds a good amount of the sodium too. To lighten it up, go easy on the syrup or use a little less cold foam on top!</p>



<p>Total nutritional content <em>per serving</em> is: </p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Calories: 215 calories</li>



<li>Total Fat: 12 grams</li>



<li>Protein: 2 grams</li>



<li>Sodium: 185 mg</li>



<li>Carbohydrates: 25 grams</li>



<li>Sugar: 20 grams</li>
</ul>



